      "start": "00:13:46.110",
      "end": "00:13:49.450",
      "text": "but for public transparency, I will read it."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:13:49.450",
      "end": "00:13:52.350",
      "text": "It is a bylaw to authorize the city treasurer"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:13:52.350",
      "end": "00:13:54.620",
      "text": "to approve internal audit services agreement"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:13:54.620",
      "end": "00:13:58.610",
      "text": "between the corporation of the city of London and MNPLLP,"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:13:58.610",
      "end": "00:14:00.020",
      "text": "and to authorize the mayor and city clerk"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:14:00.020",
      "end": "00:14:01.150",
      "text": "to execute an agreement."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:14:01.150",
      "end": "00:14:04.180",
      "text": "Whereas subsection five, three of the municipal act,"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:14:04.180",
      "end": "00:14:08.470",
      "text": "2001, SO-2001, C-25 as amended provides"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:14:08.470",
      "end": "00:14:11.640",
      "text": "that municipal powers shall be exercised by bylaw,"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:14:11.640",
      "end": "00:14:13.060",
      "text": "and whereas section nine of the municipal act"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:14:13.060",
      "end": "00:14:15.050",
      "text": "provides a municipality has the capacity rights"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:14:15.050",
      "end": "00:14:16.830",
      "text": "and privileges of a national person"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:14:16.830",
      "end": "00:14:19.080",
      "text": "for the purpose of exercising its authority"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:14:19.080",
      "end": "00:14:20.110",
      "text": "under this or any other act,"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:14:20.110",
      "end": "00:14:22.660",
      "text": "and whereas subsection 10, two of the municipal act"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:14:22.660",
      "end": "00:14:24.690",
      "text": "provides that a municipality may pass bylaws"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:14:24.690",
      "end": "00:14:26.760",
      "text": "respecting the governance structure of a municipality"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:14:26.760",
      "end": "00:14:28.270",
      "text": "and its local board's accountability"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:14:28.270",
      "end": "00:14:29.980",
      "text": "and transparency of the municipality,"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:14:29.980",
      "end": "00:14:32.010",
      "text": "and its operations of its local boards"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:14:32.010",
      "end": "00:14:33.730",
      "text": "and their operations and the financial management"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:14:33.730",
      "end": "00:14:35.120",
      "text": "of the municipality and the local boards,"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:14:35.120",
      "end": "00:14:39.320",
      "text": "and whereas municipality has approved the appointment"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:14:39.320",
      "end": "00:14:43.180",
      "text": "of MNPLLP to provide internal audit services."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:14:43.180",
      "end": "00:14:45.920",
      "text": "Now, therefore, the municipal council of the city of London"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:14:45.920",
      "end": "00:14:47.710",
      "text": "shall enact the following one."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:14:47.710",
      "end": "00:14:50.130",
      "text": "City treasurer is authorized to approve an agreement"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:14:50.130",
      "end": "00:14:53.310",
      "text": "between the corporation of the city of London and MNPLLP"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:14:53.310",
      "end": "00:14:56.560",
      "text": "to provide internal audit services, the agreement,"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:14:56.560",
      "end": "00:14:59.350",
      "text": "to the mayor and city clerk are hereby authorized"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:14:59.350",
      "end": "00:15:01.770",
      "text": "to execute the agreement by the city treasurer"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:15:01.770",
      "end": "00:15:04.520",
      "text": "under the delegated authority provided in section one"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:15:04.520",
      "end": "00:15:06.710",
      "text": "of this bylaw, three, the bylaw shall come"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:15:06.710",
      "end": "00:15:09.050",
      "text": "into force and effect on the day that it is passed,"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:15:09.050",
      "end": "00:15:10.530",
      "text": "and then the references for the passing,"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:15:10.530",
      "end": "00:15:13.950",
      "text": "which has not happened yet because it goes to council first."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:15:13.950",
      "end": "00:15:18.220",
      "text": "Ms. Higgs, that is a multi-part motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:15:18.220",
      "end": "00:15:20.480",
      "text": "Are you willing to move that then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:15:20.480",
      "end": "00:15:22.660",
      "text": "Yes. - Okay, and a seconder,"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:15:22.660",
      "end": "00:15:33.390",
      "text": "Councillor Vanholst, any discussion on the motion?"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:15:33.390",
      "end": "00:15:36.520",
      "text": "I will, if you'll allow me to speak from the chair,"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:15:36.520",
      "end": "00:15:38.900",
      "text": "I'm gonna make one comment."
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:15:38.900",
      "end": "00:15:40.370",
      "text": "Certainly, I'm supportive of the motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:15:40.370",
      "end": "00:15:44.310",
      "text": "I think it was a robust RFP process."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:15:44.310",
      "end": "00:15:46.190",
      "text": "What I do wanna say at this point is,"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:15:46.190",
      "end": "00:15:49.100",
      "text": "I would like to thank all of the staff teams"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:15:49.100",
      "end": "00:15:52.930",
      "text": "who did all of the work in supporting the RFP process"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:15:52.930",
      "end": "00:15:55.960",
      "text": "from the development of the RFP to all of the assessment."
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:15:55.960",
      "end": "00:15:58.390",
      "text": "There were obviously many people involved."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:15:58.390",
      "end": "00:16:00.900",
      "text": "These things don't just come to a vote at council,"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:16:00.900",
      "end": "00:16:03.730",
      "text": "but it is a function of a lot of work by a lot of people."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:16:03.730",
      "end": "00:16:06.560",
      "text": "I also wanna thank all the proponents who applied"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:16:06.560",
      "end": "00:16:08.990",
      "text": "to the position and their interest in it."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": "00:16:08.990",
      "end": "00:16:11.430",
      "text": "Again, I'm supportive of the motion,"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": "00:16:11.430",
      "end": "00:16:16.160",
      "text": "and if there's no further discussion, we can move to a vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": "00:16:16.160",
      "end": "00:16:20.640",
      "text": "Okay, all those in favor of the motion as a stance?"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": "00:16:20.640",
      "end": "00:16:23.260",
      "text": "That motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": "00:16:23.260",
      "end": "00:16:25.070",
      "text": "Okay, and given there's nothing else"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": "00:16:25.070",
      "end": "00:16:29.720",
      "text": "on this special agenda, all I have left is a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": "00:16:29.720",
      "end": "00:16:30.540",
      "text": "We'd like to move that."
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": "00:16:30.540",
      "end": "00:16:32.850",
      "text": "Councilor Van Holst, seconded by Ms. Higgs."
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": "00:16:32.850",
      "end": "00:16:35.630",
      "text": "All those in favor of adjournment?"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": "00:16:35.630",
      "end": "00:16:36.470",
      "text": "Motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": "00:16:36.470",
      "end": "00:16:37.310",
      "text": "And we are adjourned."
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": "00:16:37.310",
      "end": "00:16:38.530",
      "text": "Thank you for your time today, everyone."
    }
  ],
